        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu Yehova wakababesha leviyatani kapela kendaŋa lufuchi, leviyatani kapela kadijiŋajiŋaŋa, wakakababesha nampokuyindi yakabali, yakala yeneni yasweja Ŋovu. Wakajaha nichanza ŋombiwekala mukaluŋalwiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu mwakela nenu, Itempa danyivinyu, diimbilenu tumina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Yehova yami nadihembaŋa; nukuditukumwinaŋa hanti nahanti; nukudihembaŋa niwufuku nimwaana, kuchinamuntu kuditamisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudami himudi jakulendumukaku; yikwatananyiŋa mutenowu yadi kudasa njita nanami! Nadi kwendela hadi wena, nadi kuyochela hamu bwi-i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukunkulwayi akwati kuŊovu yami, kulondatuvumbiki nawu ikala; mwalala kwaamu tuvumbiki nawu ikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku akenza Yakoba wakamena nyiji; Isarela wakakenuka nkenu, wakamena ninyitombu; wakawanisha nyikabu mwahita mpata yamunu mwishina yejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena neti antu indi neyi cheteluwu antu ayeteli wena, tahindi? Wenaanayijihi chakweseka nachajahiluwu antu, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakamutwala owu mumbanda wakatadika nindi chakwesekela hohu; yena namufumishuku nampepela yindi yaŋovu mwifuku dampepela yakumusela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheni chidichi chakabutawu nachu kuluwa kwaYakoba, diyi nyikabu yejima yinafumi hakufumisha nshidi yindi; chakabalumunayi malola ejima akukameŋa ekali neyi mpeza yanatwuwu, kulonda ninyiyombu yenu niakishienu etaŋwa akabuli kunyamuka cheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mukala wampwembu wudi hakanka wawu, himukala washiyawu dehi, walekawu dehi neyi isaŋadakadi antu; kwoku kwakadiilayi mwana kaŋombi, kwoku kwakakambamayi, hakanoŋeshelaku ninyitayi yanyitondu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyitayi yakwenoku chiyikuuma akayikotolaku, ambanda akenza nakuyocha kesi; muloŋa hiyantu akadikashinshi, dichi wayileŋeli hakayitiyila wushonaku, wayiwumbili hakayitoŋa aku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu Yehova wakakupula nyikabu yindi kufumisha kudibaji daKaloŋa anamutuukishi kukakaloŋa kakuEjipitu, akayi kumaŋeja wumu wumu, enu anyana kaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu akemba mpùŋa yeneni, wampwembu wudi kujiyila mwituŋa daAshuri, ninawa ahaŋiluwu adi mwituŋa daEjipitu, akenza, akadifukula kudi Yehova hampidi yajila kuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
